data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_03d81f8d50c422db016ac962b9e5e887d1b15623b6da67a104","output_index":0,"sequence_number":83,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering server implementation**\n\nI’m thinking about implementing a server that serves static HTML and utilizes a JavaScript API for the browser. I need to test the integration with Node.js, possibly using a temporary database. Reloading and restarting the server for health checks seems essential, especially if things go invalid. I’m hoping to manage my time effectively here, so it’s all about finding that balance to get everything running smoothly!"}

